# Coxiella burnetii MLVA of Arricau-Bouvery et al. 2006, in the published order: the ten panel 1
# minisatellites (repeat unit above 9 bp) followed by the seven panel 2 microsatellites (6 or 7 bp
# units). The locus ids are the short ms names; the label column of markers.tsv keeps the full
# MLVAbank identifier, which also carries the gene name of the Nine Mile RSA 493 annotation.
#
# The expected size is a search window, not a reference product. It spans the published estimated
# size range, extended to include the size measured in RSA 493, less 50 bp at the low end and plus
# 200 bp at the high end. It only bounds the search and does not affect allele calls.
